 leading-[1rem]" data-testid="date-separator">•</span><details class="inline" data-testid="update-date-details"><summary class="inline cursor-pointer list-none" data-testid="update-date-toggle"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 inline leading-[1rem] whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="update-date">May 17, 2026</span></summary><span class="block" data-testid="date-expanded"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 block leading-[1rem]" data-testid="update-date-full">Updated: May 17, 2026, 9:23 am EDT</span><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 block leading-[1rem]" data-testid="publish-date-full">Published: May 16, 2026, 10:19 am EDT</span></span></details></div></div><div class="mt-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><button class="cursor-pointer items-center px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-500 rounded-lg border border-[#676767] bg-transparent flex" data-testid="view-comments-button"><div class="flex items-center gap-1" data-testid="view-comments-button-content"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="inline-block w-4 h-4 text-gray-900 m-0" data-testid="comments-icon"><title>Description</title><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M8.87 15 8 14.5l2-3.5h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4.5v1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2.42z" /><path d="M12 5H4v1h8zM9 8H4v1h5z" /></g></svg><p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-tight text-brand-dark m-0 font-bold" data-testid="comments-text">Start the conversation</p></div></button><div class="flex items-center justify-between" data-testid="share-container"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_1_" data-state="closed" data-slot="popover-trigger"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center text-sm text-gray-500 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-[#676767] bg-transparent" data-testid="share-button"><div class="align-center flex items-center" data-testid="share-button-content"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="inline-block w-4 h-4 text-gray-900 m-0 mr-[8px]" data-testid="share-icon-image"><title>Share</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.5 10a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.944.945L5.9 8.66a2.23 2.23 0 0 0 0-1.32l3.655-2.285A2.5 2.5 0 1 0 9 3.5q.004.337.1.66L5.446 6.445a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 3.11L9.1 11.84a2.4 2.4 0 0 0-.1.66 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 2.5-2.5m0-8a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3m-8 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3m8 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3" /></svg><p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-tight text-brand-dark m-0 font-bold" data-testid="share-button-text">Share</p></div></div></button></div></div></div><div class="flatplan_body" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_body"><div><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="109th Running Of The Indianapolis 500" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_mainMedia" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full flatplan_mainMedia" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 91vw, (max-width: 1280px) 64vw, 800px" srcset="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=640&quality=60 640w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=750&quality=60 750w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=828&quality=60 828w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1080&quality=60 1080w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1280&quality=60 1280w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60 1600w" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"><figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm leading-tight"><p>INDIANAPOLIS, INDIANA - MAY 25: Jack Harvey, driver of the #24 DRR Cusick Invst Chevrolet, leads a pack of cars during the NTT IndyCar Series109th Running Of The Indianapolis 500 at Indianapolis Motor Speedway on May 25, 2025 in Indianapolis, Indiana. (Photo by James Gilbert/Getty Images)</p><p class="m-0 text-gray-500">(Getty Images)</p></figcaption></figure><p><br></p><p>The first round of qualifying for the 110th Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday, leading to a busy, condensed schedule on Sunday.</p><p>Storms and showers rained out practice on Saturday morning and kept coming into the afternoon, forcing IndyCar to push all qualifying to Sunday.</p><div class="flex items-center">
        <div class="twitter-tweet twitter-tweet-rendered" style="display: flex; max-width: 550px; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><iframe id="twitter-widget-0" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowtransparency="true" allowfullscreen="true" title="X Post" src="https://platform.twitter.com/embed/Tweet.html?dnt=false&embedId=twitter-widget-0&%3D%3D&frame=false&hideCard=false&hideThread=true&id=2055735182292828440&lang=en&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fweather.com%2F2026%2F05%2F16%2Fnews%2Fweather%2Frain-delays-qualifying-for-the-indy-500&sessionId=37534f00c49b897fb8abdba78b3632629317a96d&siteScreenName=weatherchannel&theme=light&widgetsVersion=6a3ad42b224df%3A1778106238597&width=550px" style="position: static; visibility: visible; width: 550px; height: 873px; display: block; flex-grow: 1;" data-tweet-id="2055735182292828440"></iframe></div>
      </div><p><br></p><p>Qualifying will begin at noon on Sunday, and each driver will only get one try at qualifying for the Fast 12 and a second qualifying session. More on this procedure can be found <a href="https://www.indycar.com/-/media/Files/2026/NICS/07-500/indycar-QualDraw-Sat-26I500.pdf" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>. </p><p>Fortunately for IndyCar, Sunday's activities at Indianapolis Motor Speedway won't be rained out. Forecasters are calling for a dry, warm and mostly sunny day on Sunday.</p><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="Indianapolis forecast" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 91vw, (max-width: 1280px) 64vw, 800px" srcset="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=640&quality=60 640w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=750&quality=60 750w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=828&quality=60 828w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1080&quality=60 1080w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1280&quality=60 1280w, https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60 1600w" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"></figure><p>The green flag will drop on the iconic race at 12:45 p.m. on May 24.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6" id="comments-section"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-6 min-h-[60px]"><div data-spotim-app="reactions" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-theme="TWC Buddies" class="min-h-[60px]"><ow-7lom3kneatg></ow-7lom3kneatg></div><div class="absolu